chapter.v:
For zeal 


for your, 


house has consumed me, and the reproaches of those who reproach you have fallen on me.

But as 


for me,, 


my prayer is to you, O LORD. At an acceptable time, O God, in the abundance of your steadfast love answer me in your saving faithfulness.

Deliver me 


from sinking, 


in the mire; let me be delivered from my enemies and from the deep waters.

For God 


will save, 


Zion and build up the cities of Judah, and people shall dwell there and possess it;
